/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Sustainability-Linked Intermediated Debt Instrument \(SLIDI\) proposal seeks to address the limitations of existing sustainability-linked bonds \(SLBs\), which have seen a decline in issuance since their peak in 2021. Like SLBs, SLIDIs offer reduced interest rates or rebates to borrowers that achieve specific sustainability-linked Key Performance Indicators \(KPIs\). However, SLIDIs differ by raising funds through bonds with fixed coupon payments, eliminating the rate-of-return uncertainty faced by SLBs.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
