/S /H3
/T (REDUCING BORROWING COSTS FOR EMDEs: The private sector will need to supply about 80% of the required climate-related investment in emerging market and developing economies \(WB, 2023\). Due to currency risk and other country risks,  such as geopolitical conflicts, institutional investors are often unwilling to invest in developing countries, or demand punitively high interest rates to do so. )
/E (REDUCING BORROWING COSTS FOR EMDEs: The private sector will need to supply about 80% of the required climate-related investment in emerging market and developing economies \(WB, 2023\). Due to currency risk and other country risks,  such as geopolitical conflicts, institutional investors are often unwilling to invest in developing countries, or demand punitively high interest rates to do so. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
