/P 1003 0 R
/ActualText (Policymakers are able to ease the transition to a low-carbon economy by creating a system that functions like a gradually increasing carbon tax. This avoids the need for repeated political battles that would arise with each proposed hike in a traditional carbon tax.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
