/ActualText (Broaden the range of financial instruments available to sustainably finance the renewable energy sector by mitigating risks that could hinder project performance. Many of these risks can be managed through government intervention. For instance, state or regional governments could pre-assemble land and make it available for hybrid solar PV and wind power development projects. Additionally, de-risking operating-phase financing could involve a third-party financing agency guaranteeing PPAs.)
